  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "A burgundy varsity jacket suits everyday wearers who like deeper colors and a classic silhouette. Cream sleeves soften the burgundy body for an understated look that works with denim and simple casual layers.\n\nDetails\n- Body: burgundy 24 oz melton wool\n- Sleeves: cream genuine cowhide leather\n- Trim: burgundy and cream striped knit collar, cuffs and waistband\n- Lining: quilted lining\n- Closure: snap-button front\n- Pockets: two welt pockets\n- Fit: True-to-size fit; compare your measurements with the size guide\n- Sizes: XXS through 6XL\n\nCustomization options\n- Chenille letter and name embroidery\n- Number, patches and back lettering\n- Free digital design proof before production.\n\nExplore burgundy letterman jacket styling or maroon and cream varsity jacket with your own personal details. Choose your layout through our [custom letterman jacket](/custom-letterman-jackets) options and review the placement before production.\n\nProduction and delivery\nMade in our Sialkot factory. Made in 6–7 business days after design approval. Delivery in 5–7 business days.",
